START

Set the player's starting room to the Ticket Booth.

WHILE the game is active

```
Display the player's current room.

Display the available movement directions.

Ask the player to enter a direction: north, south, east, or west.

IF the player enters north

    IF a room exists to the north of the current room

        Move the player to the room to the north.

        Display the player's new room.

    ELSE

        Display "You cannot move north from this room."

    END IF

ELSE IF the player enters south

    IF a room exists to the south of the current room

        Move the player to the room to the south.

        Display the player's new room.

    ELSE

        Display "You cannot move south from this room."

    END IF

ELSE IF the player enters east

    IF a room exists to the east of the current room

        Move the player to the room to the east.

        Display the player's new room.

    ELSE

        Display "You cannot move east from this room."

    END IF

ELSE IF the player enters west

    IF a room exists to the west of the current room

        Move the player to the room to the west.

        Display the player's new room.

    ELSE

        Display "You cannot move west from this room."

    END IF

ELSE

    Display "Invalid direction. Please enter north, south, east, or west."

END IF
```

END WHILE

END

